[{"title":"送朝天续集归诚斋时在金陵","author":"姜夔","text":"翰墨场中老斲轮，真能一笔扫千军。\n年年花月无閒日，处处山川怕见君。\n箭在的中非尔力，风行水上自成文。\n先生只可三千首，回首江东日暮云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38269,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄上张参政","author":"姜夔","text":"姑苏台下梅花树，应为调羹故早开。\n燕寝休誇香雾重，鸳行却望衮衣来。\n前时甲第仍垂柳，今度沙堤已种槐。\n应念无枝夜飞鹊，月寒风劲羽毛摧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38270,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"京口留别张思顺","author":"姜夔","text":"伯劳飞燕若为忙，还忆东斋夜共床。\n别后无书非弃我，春前会面却他乡。\n连宵为说经忧患，异日相逢各老苍。\n更欲少留天不许，晓风吹艇入垂杨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38271,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次朴翁游兰亭韵","author":"姜夔","text":"亚字桥亭面面风，六人同坐树阴中。\n松交归路如留客，石碍流杯故恼公。\n山色最怜秦望绿，野花只作晋时红。\n夕阳啼鸟人将散，俯仰兴怀自昔同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38272,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵胡仲方因杨伯子见寄","author":"姜夔","text":"此去庐陵定几程，向来邛杖未经行。\n悬知征棹云边集，大有吟情雪里生。\n楚渡食萍应甚美，舜祠吹玉直能清。\n二君即日青冥上，惟我春山带雨耕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38273,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贺张肖翁参政","author":"姜夔","text":"太乙图书客屡谈，已知上相出淮南。\n银台日月非虚过，金鼎功名得细参。\n从此与人为雨露，应怜有客卧云岚。\n明朝起为苍生贺，旋著藤冠紫竹簪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38274,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陈君玉以小集见归用余还诚斋朝天续集韵作七字夔报贶","author":"姜夔","text":"笔阵无功汗左轮，而今老去不能军。\n水边白鸟閒于我，窗外梅花疑是君。\n欲向江湖行此语，可无朋友托斯文。\n新篇大是相料理，因忆西山扬子云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38275,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄田郎","author":"姜夔","text":"楚楚田郎亦大奇，少年风味我曾知。\n春城寒食谁相伴，夜月梨花有所思。\n剪烛屡呼金凿落，倚窗閒品玉参差。\n含情不拟逢人说，鹦鹉能歌自作词。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38276,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送王德和提举淮东","author":"姜夔","text":"京尘吹帽汗淋衣，相见频年只道归。\n省里移文那得了，家边持节未为非。\n煮乾碧海知谁用，割尽黄云尚告饥。\n可得不为根本计，秋风还见雁南飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38277,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄时父","author":"姜夔","text":"迟君日日数归程，到得君归我已行。\n一路好山思共看，半年有酒不同倾。\n吾侪正坐清贫累，各自而今白发生。\n人物渺然须强饭，天工应不负才名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38278,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送李万顷","author":"姜夔","text":"猛相思里得君来，正喜欢时却便回。\n别路恐无青柳折，到家应有小桃开。\n起居五马兼堂上，问信千岩及阿灰。\n儿女痴顽夫妇健，漂零何日共尊罍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38279,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵千岩杂谣","author":"姜夔","text":"中散平生七不堪，凤麈时时伴燕谈。\n道士有神传火枣，故人无字入云蓝。\n雨凉竹叶宜三酌，日落荷花倚半酣。\n极欲扁舟南荡去，冷鸥轻燕略相谙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38280,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄上郑郎中","author":"姜夔","text":"梅根东望九华云，中有风流衣绣人。\n名下一生劳梦想，尊前数语倍情亲。\n节旄在道催归汉，花鸟留君且作春。\n见说祥风挟时雨，故园松菊亦精神。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38281,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送左真州还长沙","author":"姜夔","text":"吴儿牵挽醉莼鲈，今日西归略自如。\n别路冷云随驿马，望乡乔木记吾庐。\n湘中花月偏怜酒，淮左儿童待拥车。\n凡我旧游君更历，橘洲相见讶无书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38282,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乍凉寄朴翁","author":"姜夔","text":"前日松间步屧归，更将荷叶障秋晖。\n如今城里抛团扇，应是山中试裌衣。\n水有秋容莲渐少，树含凉气鸟慵飞。\n炎天既懒趋城市，从此尤须恋翠微。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38283,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"张平甫哀挽","author":"姜夔","text":"将军家世出臞儒，合上青云作计疏。\n吴下宅成花未种，湖边地吉草新锄。\n空嗟过隙催人世，赖有提孩读父书。\n他日石羊芳草路，弟兄来此一沾裾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38284,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"同潘德久作明妃诗三首 其一","author":"姜夔","text":"明妃未嫁时，满宫妒娥眉。\n一朝辞玉陛，人人泪双垂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38285,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"同潘德久作明妃诗三首 其二","author":"姜夔","text":"年年心随雁，日日穹庐中。\n遥见沙上月，忽忆建章宫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38286,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"同潘德久作明妃诗三首 其三","author":"姜夔","text":"身同汉使来，不同汉使归。\n虽为塞外妇，只著汉家衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38287,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东堂联句","author":"姜夔","text":"金风凉夜深，吹我萧萧发。\n起折丹桂枝，惊落花上月。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38288,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与和甫时甫分题画卷夔得剡溪图","author":"姜夔","text":"枯槎啅乾鹊，交臂失夫君。\n奈此一尊酒，凭高空水云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38289,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金神夜猎图二首 其一","author":"姜夔","text":"夜半金神羽猎，奔走山川百灵。\n云气旌旗来下，飒然已入青冥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38290,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金神夜猎图二首 其二","author":"姜夔","text":"后宫婵娟玉女，自鞚八尺飞龙。\n两两鸣鞭争导，绿云斜坠春风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38291,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵鸳鸯梅二首 其一","author":"姜夔","text":"晴日小溪沙暖，春梦怜渠颈交。\n只怕笛声惊散，费人月咏风嘲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38292,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵鸳鸯梅二首 其二","author":"姜夔","text":"漠漠江南烟雨，于飞似报初春。\n折过女郎山下，料应愁杀佳人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38293,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"马上值牧儿","author":"姜夔","text":"马背何如牛背，短衣落日空山。\n只么身归盘谷，未须名满人间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38294,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雁图","author":"姜夔","text":"万里晴沙夕照西，此心唯有断云知。\n年年数尽秋风字，想见江南摇落时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38295,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"除夜自石湖归苕溪十首 其一","author":"姜夔","text":"细草穿沙雪半销，吴宫烟冷水迢迢。\n梅花竹里无人见，一夜吹香过石桥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38296,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"除夜自石湖归苕溪十首 其二","author":"姜夔","text":"美人台上昔欢娱，今日空台望五湖。\n残雪未融青草死，苦无麋鹿过姑苏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38297,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"除夜自石湖归苕溪十首 其三","author":"姜夔","text":"黄帽传呼睡不成，投篙细细激流冰。\n分明旧泊江南岸，舟尾春风飐客灯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38298,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"除夜自石湖归苕溪十首 其四","author":"姜夔","text":"千门列炬散林鸦，儿女相思未到家。\n应是不眠非守岁，小窗春色入灯花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38299,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"除夜自石湖归苕溪十首 其五","author":"姜夔","text":"三生定是陆天随，又向吴松作客归。\n已拚新年舟上过，倩人和雪洗征衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38300,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"除夜自石湖归苕溪十首 其六","author":"姜夔","text":"沙尾风回一棹寒，椒花今夕不登盘。\n百年草草都如此，自琢春词剪烛看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38301,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"除夜自石湖归苕溪十首 其七","author":"姜夔","text":"笠泽茫茫雁影微，玉峰重叠护云衣。\n长桥寂寞春寒夜，只有诗人一舸归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38302,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"除夜自石湖归苕溪十首 其八","author":"姜夔","text":"桑间篝火却宜蚕，风土相传我未谙。\n但得明年少行役，只裁白纻作春衫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38303,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"除夜自石湖归苕溪十首 其九","author":"姜夔","text":"少小知名翰墨场，十年心事只凄凉。\n旧时曾作梅花赋，研墨於今亦自香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38304,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"除夜自石湖归苕溪十首 其十","author":"姜夔","text":"环玦随波冷未销，古苔留雪卧墙腰。\n谁家玉笛吹春怨，看见鹅黄上柳条。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38305,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"临安旅邸答苏虞叟","author":"姜夔","text":"垂杨风雨小楼寒，宋玉秋词不忍看。\n万里青山无处隐，可怜投老客长安。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38306,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"姑苏怀古","author":"姜夔","text":"夜暗归云绕柁牙，江涵星影鹭眠沙。\n行人怅望苏台柳，曾与吴王扫落花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38307,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵德久","author":"姜夔","text":"篱落青青花倒垂，避人黄鸟雨中飞。\n西郊寂寞无车马，时有溪童卖菜归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38308,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次石湖书扇韵","author":"姜夔","text":"桥西一曲水通村，岸阁浮萍绿有痕。\n家住石湖人不到，藕花多处别开门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38309,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"竹友为徐南卿作二首 其一","author":"姜夔","text":"发已星星带已宽，徐卿犹自客长安。\n家山竹好无由看，漫种庭心一两竿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38310,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"竹友为徐南卿作二首 其二","author":"姜夔","text":"世路苍黄总是愁，暮年须得小优游。\n如今渐觉知心少，剩种青青伴白头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38311,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寿朴翁","author":"姜夔","text":"与师同月不同年，归墨归儒各自缘。\n想得山中无寿酒，但携茶到菊花前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38312,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖上寓居杂咏十四首 其一","author":"姜夔","text":"荷叶披披一浦凉，青芦奕奕夜吟商。\n平生最识江湖味，听得秋声忆故乡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38313,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖上寓居杂咏十四首 其二","author":"姜夔","text":"湖上风恬月澹时，卧看云影入玻瓈。\n轻舟忽向窗边过，摇动青芦一两枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38314,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖上寓居杂咏十四首 其三","author":"姜夔","text":"秋风低结乱山愁，千顷银波凝不流。\n堤畔画船堤上马，绿杨风里两悠悠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38315,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖上寓居杂咏十四首 其四","author":"姜夔","text":"处处虚堂望眼宽，荷花荷叶过阑干。\n游人去后无歌鼓，白水青山生晚寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38316,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖上寓居杂咏十四首 其五","author":"姜夔","text":"辇路垂杨两行栽，苑门秋水欲平阶。\n朝朝南望宫云起，白鸟一双山下来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38317,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖上寓居杂咏十四首 其六","author":"姜夔","text":"微波冲得绿萍开，数点青青黏石阶。\n绿葑自来还自去，来时须载白鸥来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38318,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖上寓居杂咏十四首 其七","author":"姜夔","text":"布衣何用揖王公，归向芦根濯软红。\n自觉此心无一事，小鱼跳出绿萍中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38319,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖上寓居杂咏十四首 其八","author":"姜夔","text":"囊封万字总空言，露滴桐枝欲断弦。\n时事悠悠吾亦懒，卧看秋水浸山烟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38320,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖上寓居杂咏十四首 其九","author":"姜夔","text":"苑墙曲曲柳冥冥，人静山空见一灯。\n荷叶似云香不断，小船摇曳入西陵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38321,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖上寓居杂咏十四首 其十","author":"姜夔","text":"处士风流不并时，移家相近若依依。\n夜凉一舸孤山下，林黑草深萤火飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38322,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖上寓居杂咏十四首 其十一","author":"姜夔","text":"卧榻看山绿涨天，角门长泊钓鱼船。\n而今渐欲抛尘事，未了菟裘一怅然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38323,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖上寓居杂咏十四首 其十二","author":"姜夔","text":"钩窗不忍见南山，下有三雏骨未寒。\n惆怅古今同此味，二陵风雨晋师还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38324,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖上寓居杂咏十四首 其十三","author":"姜夔","text":"柳下轩窗枕水开，画船忽载故人来。\n与君同过西城路，却指烟波独自回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38325,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖上寓居杂咏十四首 其十四","author":"姜夔","text":"指点移舟著柳堤，美人相顾复相携。\n上桥更觉秋香重，花在西陵小苑西。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38326,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"平甫见招不欲往二首 其一","author":"姜夔","text":"老去无心听管弦，病来杯酒不相便。\n人生难得秋前雨，乞我虚堂自在眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38327,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"平甫见招不欲往二首 其二","author":"姜夔","text":"楼阁万重秋雨里，峰峦四合暮潮边。\n凤城今夕凉如水，多少人家试管弦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38328,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三高祠","author":"姜夔","text":"越国霸来头已白，洛京归后梦犹惊。\n沈思只羡天随子，蓑笠寒江过一生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38329,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过桐庐","author":"姜夔","text":"横看山色仰看云，十幅风帆不藉人。\n记取合江江畔树，他年此处好垂纶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38330,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登乌石寺观张魏公刘安成岳武穆留题刘云侍儿意真奉命题记","author":"姜夔","text":"诸老凋零极可哀，尚留名字压崔嵬。\n刘郎可是疏文墨，几点胭脂污绿苔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38331,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过垂虹","author":"姜夔","text":"自作新词韵最娇，小红低唱我吹箫。\n曲终过尽松陵路，回首烟波十四桥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38332,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"访费山人","author":"姜夔","text":"稻丛茁茁欲齐肩，杨柳僛僛不蔽蝉。\n忽忆石头城下路，槿花斜压钓鱼船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38333,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"牛渚","author":"姜夔","text":"牛渚矶边渺渺秋，笛声吹月下中流。\n西风不识张京兆，画得蛾眉如许愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38334,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"武康丞宅同朴翁咏牵牛","author":"姜夔","text":"青花绿叶上疏篱，别有长条竹尾垂。\n老觉淡妆差有味，满身秋露立多时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38335,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"朴翁悼牵牛甚奇余亦作","author":"姜夔","text":"不见青青绕竹生，西风篱落抱枯藤。\n道人一任空花过，愁杀山阴觅句僧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38336,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过德清二首 其一","author":"姜夔","text":"木末谁家缥缈亭，画堂临水更虚明。\n经过此处无相识，塔下秋云为我生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38337,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过德清二首 其二","author":"姜夔","text":"溪上佳人看客舟，舟中行客思悠悠。\n烟波渐远桥东去，犹见阑干一点愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38338,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"项里","author":"姜夔","text":"旧国婆娑几树梅，将军逐鹿未归来。\n江东父老空相忆，枝上年年长绿苔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38339,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪中六解 其一","author":"姜夔","text":"塞草汀云护玉鞍，连天花落路漫漫。\n如今却忆当时健，下马题诗不怕寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38340,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪中六解 其二","author":"姜夔","text":"黄鹤矶边晚渡时，柳花风急片帆飞。\n一声长笛鱼龙舞，白浪如山不肯归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38341,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪中六解 其三","author":"姜夔","text":"万马行空转屋檐，高寒屡索酒杯添。\n故人家住吴山上，借得西湖自捲帘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38342,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪中六解 其四","author":"姜夔","text":"曾泛扁舟访石湖，恍然坐我范宽图。\n天寒远挂一行雁，三十六峰生玉壶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":38343,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]